Illini Drainage System Design
QGIS plugin: designs a complete subsurface tile drainage system from drawn
mains and submains (Illini Drainage Tools routines E-K).
Copyright (C) 2026 Anamelechi Falasy and Richard Cooke

Based on the Illini Drainage Tools, Copyright (C) 2022 University of
Illinois, Urbana-Champaign USA (Anamelechi Falasy and Richard Cooke), licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3 or later; see LICENSE_ILLINI_DRAINAGE_TOOLS.txt.
The algorithm files (benefits_algorithm.py, bury_algorithm.py,
flow_lengths_algorithm.py, geometrically_fixed_algorithm.py,
network_elevation_algorithm.py, network_flow_ordering_algorithm.py,
network_generator_algorithm.py) are modified versions of the Illini Drainage
Tools files of the same names.

